<title>BRAZIL: Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</title>
<headline>Brazil orange juice industry reports weekly output.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brazilian Association of Citrus Exporters reported the following output and exports of frozen concentrated orange juice in metric tonnes 66 Brix for the period June 22-29 and the total so far in 1996/97.</p>
<p>		June 22-29   June 24-30     TOTAL	  TOTAL</p>
<p>		 1996/97     1995/96	1996/97	1995/96</p>
<p> Stocks/open    146,120.8   155,140.5</p>
<p> Production		 0	     0   1,089,679.4    973,306.9</p>
<p> Shipment	  36,623.4    72,935.3   1,133,457.3  1,046,242.2</p>
<p> Home Market	  156.7	 336.1	16,329.2     18,466.3</p>
<p> Stocks/close   109,340.7   169,940.6</p>
<p>((-Caroline Bulloch, Rio de Janeiro newsroom, 5521 5074151))</p>
</text>
